        "original_id": "97a1207d-cb33-5537-9ead-89f4c3be61f3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: VIVA Media GmbH, Viacom International Media Networks Europe\n- Products: Viva (UK and Ireland)\n- Concepts: Gesellschaft mit beschränkter Haftung (GmbH)\n- Places: Germany, United Kingdom, Ireland, Austria, Switzerland, Liechtenstein\n- Topics: UK R&B chart, music television channels\n\nFacts:\n- VIVA Media GmbH, called VIVA Media AG until 2004, is a music television network originating from Germany.\n- A Gesellschaft mit beschränkter Haftung, abbreviated GmbH and also GesmbH in Austria, is a common legal entity type in Germany, Austria, Switzerland, and Liechtenstein.\n- In Switzerland, a Gesellschaft mit beschränkter Haftung is equivalent to an S.à r.l.\n- Viva, stylised as VIVA, is a music television channel in the United Kingdom and Ireland.\n- Viva in the United Kingdom and Ireland is owned by VIVA Media and thereby by Viacom International Media Networks Europe.\n- The UK R&B chart is shown regularly on music channels including Kiss, Viva UK, MTV Base, and MTV Hits.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
